;; Banner Ontology (旗 hata) — ideology / faction (意識的 power-camp) overlay.
;; The (B) extension of tsumugi 紡ぎ.
;; ADR-2606092000  (extends ADR-2606011800 tsumugi · ADR-2606061500 influence-history
;;                  · ADR-2605081300 edge-primary karma · ADR-2606042330 mirror invariant
;;                  · ADR-2605192100 Charter §1.15 non-eschatological · ADR-2605262130 kotoba)
;;
;; PURPOSE. tsumugi's diachronic extension (ADR-2606061500) models thought-STREAMS flowing
;; through HISTORY. This schema projects those streams FORWARD into the PRESENT as 旗 (hata,
;; "banners"): the ideological standards under which present-day public-power entities openly
;; align. A 旗 captures the *意識的* (conscious / declared) axis of power that the structural
;; 縁-graph alone misses — which camp an entity flies its colours with, and how today's
;; factions descend from historical 思潮.
;;
;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
;; THE THOUGHT-POLICING GUARD — this is the highest-risk actor extension; these gates are
;; the reason it is safe to represent ideology at all. Touch one → touch its three sites
;; (this :db/allowed vector + the lexicon :const + the Python ValueError in analyze_banner).
;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
;;
;;   H1  PUBLIC-DECLARED BASIS ONLY. :flies/basis ∈ {:self-declared :public-stated
;;       :voting-record :formal-membership} — all OBSERVABLE, on-the-record. Inferring a
;;       hidden / private / "real" ideology is UNREPRESENTABLE: :inferred / :suspected /
;;       :imputed are NOT enum members (validator raises). We record only what an entity has
;;       PUT ON THE RECORD about itself, or a formal public act (a vote, a membership).
;;
;;   H2  NON-ADJUDICATING — NO THREAT LABELS. :banner/kind is a DESCRIPTIVE closed vocab.
;;       Verdict / threat tokens (:extremist :radical :dangerous :過激 :危険思想 :反社会
;;       :terrorist) are NOT enum members and unrepresentable. A banner is a standard someone
;;       flies, never a danger-classification of them. There is NO :banner/threat-level and
;;       NO :ent/loyalty field. nonAdjudicating = const true.
;;
;;   H3  EDGE-PRIMARY / NO SCORE-OF-CONVICTION (inherits tsumugi N1/G2). Alignment lives ONLY
;;       on the :flies/* edge. There is NO :ent/ideology-score, :ent/conviction, or
;;       :ent/leaning scalar. A camp's reach is the INTEGRAL of incident :flies edges,
;;       computed on read. We do not rank souls by belief.
;;
;;   H4  PERSON-EXCLUDED / SEAT-ONLY (inherits tsumugi G1 / keizu G1). :flies/who must
;;       reference an :institutional / :public-seat entity. A private individual's ideology
;;       is UNREPRESENTABLE. This is NOT a registry of what people believe. No blacklist
;;       export; aggregate-first only.
;;
;;   H5  MIRROR + SYMMETRIC. Banners are OBSERVATIONS about public alignment (mirror, never
;;       endorsement or denunciation). The ONE banner etzhayyim itself flies — its declared
;;       Charter genealogy — is modeled as the self node's INBOUND-only banner (the actor
;;       discloses its own colours; it does not pretend to be neutral while judging others).
;;
;;   H6  PLURAL + CONTESTED. An entity MAY fly many banners; banners overlap and conflict.
;;       There is no exclusivity constraint and no single-label forcing — :flies is many-to-
;;       many. Entities flying ≥2 banners are surfaced as BRIDGES (pluralism), not anomalies.
;;
;;   H7  SOURCING (inherits tsumugi G5). Every :flies carries :flies/sources (≥2 public
;;       citations — the entity's OWN manifesto / public statement / recorded vote) +
;;       :flies/sourcing. Under-sourced alignment RAISES.
;;
;; Net effect: this schema can say "Party X self-declares banner B (per its own manifesto)"
;; and "banner B descends from historical stream S"; it CANNOT say "entity Y is secretly
;; extremist", "person Z believes W", or rank anyone by conviction. By construction.
;;
;; STATUS: R0 design-only (ADR-2606092000). The committed seed aligns only SELF-DECLARED
;; public org platforms + abstract doctrinal/school banners tied to historical streams.
;; Live entity↔banner ingest (voting records, manifestos at scale) is G7/Council-gated.

[;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 ;; :banner/* — an ideological standard (旗印); descriptive, never a threat-class
 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 {:db/ident :banner/id    :db/doc "stable banner id, e.g. banner.jp.kenpou-kaisei"}
 {:db/ident :banner/label :db/doc "human label of the standard"}
 {:db/ident :banner/kind
  :db/doc "H2 — DESCRIPTIVE banner kind; CLOSED. No threat/verdict tokens."
  :db/allowed [:political-platform  ;; a declared party / movement platform
               :doctrinal           ;; a religious / philosophical doctrine
               :school-of-thought   ;; an intellectual school (主義) — textbook category
               :policy-stance]}     ;; a stance on a specific public-policy axis
 {:db/ident :banner/thought-stream
  :db/doc "H5 genealogy — optional link to an influence-history stream (ADR-2606061500),
           e.g. :stream/enlightenment-liberalism; projects history → present"}
 {:db/ident :banner/axis  :db/doc "optional contested axis this banner sits on (e.g. \"改憲↔護憲\")"}
 {:db/ident :banner/sourcing :db/allowed [:authoritative :representative]}

 ;; explicitly ABSENT — declaring them documents the prohibition:
 ;;   :banner/threat-level  :banner/verdict        (H2 — no danger classification)
 ;;   :ent/ideology-score   :ent/conviction        (H3 — no score-of-conviction)
 ;;   :ent/loyalty          :ent/leaning           (H2/H3)

 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 ;; :ent/* — a lightweight entity stub (a public org / seat that flies banners)
 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 {:db/ident :ent/id    :db/doc "entity id (may reference a :pwr/id or org.* node)"}
 {:db/ident :ent/label :db/doc "human label"}
 {:db/ident :ent/standing
  :db/doc "H4 person-exclusion gate; CLOSED"
  :db/allowed [:institutional :public-seat :self]}  ;; :self = the etzhayyim node (H5)

 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 ;; :flies/* — the alignment 縁 (entity flies a banner); alignment lives HERE (H3)
 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 {:db/ident :flies/id     :db/doc "stable edge id"}
 {:db/ident :flies/who    :db/doc "H4 — :ent/id; must be institutional/public-seat/self"}
 {:db/ident :flies/banner :db/doc ":banner/id"}
 {:db/ident :flies/basis
  :db/doc "H1 — how the alignment is ON THE RECORD; CLOSED. No inference."
  :db/allowed [:self-declared     ;; the entity's own public statement of its platform
               :public-stated     ;; a recorded public position attributable to the entity
               :voting-record     ;; a formal public vote
               :formal-membership]} ;; declared membership in a body/coalition
 {:db/ident :flies/weight
  :db/doc "H3 — ∈[0,1]; strength of the DECLARED alignment. THE edge-primary weight."
  :db/type :double}
 {:db/ident :flies/inbound-only
  :db/doc "H5 — true for the self node's own Charter banner (disclosed, not projected over others)"
  :db/type :boolean}
 {:db/ident :flies/sources  :db/doc "H7 — ≥2 public citations (own manifesto/statement/vote)" :db/type :vector}
 {:db/ident :flies/sourcing :db/allowed [:authoritative :representative]}

 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 ;; const guards (H1/H2/H4) — read by analyze_banner.py + test_banner.py
 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 {:db/ident :banner/nonAdjudicating :db/const true
  :db/doc "H2 — a banner is a standard flown, never a danger-classification"}
 {:db/ident :banner/mirror :db/const true
  :db/doc "H5 — observations about public alignment; etzhayyim flies only its own banner, inbound-only"}
 {:db/ident :banner/threat-tokens-forbidden
  :db/doc "H2 — MUST NOT appear as :banner/kind or anywhere; validator raises"
  :db/value [:extremist :radical :dangerous :過激 :危険思想 :反社会 :terrorist :テロ]}
 {:db/ident :banner/basis-inference-forbidden
  :db/doc "H1 — MUST NOT appear as :flies/basis; validator raises"
  :db/value [:inferred :suspected :imputed :alleged]}]
